
## 2. `.gitignore`

Open `.gitignore` and replace its contents with:

```gitignore
# Python virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Secrets and local environment configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python bytecode and caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Test, type-check and lint caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo

# Generated local vector database (rebuilds from supplied notes)
data/chroma_db/

# Build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# OS/editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/